## Getting started

```bash
git config core.hooksPath .githooks   # once per clone: scan commits for secrets
scripts/verify.sh                     # lint, types, tests, secret scan
```

## How work flows

1. Discuss and research the idea with Claude.
2. `/rb-design <name>` writes it up in `docs/architecture/`.
3. Review it and set `status: approved` in it yourself.
4. `/rb-intake <design>` breaks it into phases in `docs/plans/`.
5. `/rb-implement <plan>` builds the next phase (add `all` for every remaining phase).
